From: Armbian Build Framework <build@armbian.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm: vs: mark UAPI header with Linux syscall exception

The headers_install target rejects GPL-only UAPI headers.  Match the SPDX
identifier used by other exported DRM UAPI headers so Armbian can package
linux-libc-dev from the vendor kernel.

---
 include/uapi/drm/vs_drm.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/include/uapi/drm/vs_drm.h b/include/uapi/drm/vs_drm.h
index f66f7669..be602d13 100644
--- a/include/uapi/drm/vs_drm.h
+++ b/include/uapi/drm/vs_drm.h
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note */
 /*
  * Copyright (C) 2020 VeriSilicon Holdings Co., Ltd.
  */
-- 
2.34.1
